---
title: "C22 — Authorized socket delivery · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Handshake[Socket with JWT] --> Session[Validate live session and membership]
  Session --> Subscribe[Requested list subscription]
  Subscribe --> Access{Current list permission?}
  Access -->|No| Deny[Reject or remove subscription]
  Access -->|Yes| Room[Workspace and list room]
  Event[Private validated event] --> Recipients[Find candidate recipients]
  Room --> Recipients
  Recipients --> Recheck{Session and permission still valid?}
  Recheck -->|No| Deny
  Recheck -->|Yes| Strip[Build content-free public invalidation]
  Strip --> Emit[Emit to authorized client]
  Emit --> Refetch[Client fetches current REST state]
